*OpenUI *DeliInvert/DeliInvert: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliInvert
*DefaultDeliInvert: 0
*DeliInvert 0/位图极性: ""
*CloseUI: *DeliInvert
*OpenUI *DeliTearOff/DeliTearOff: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *DeliTearOff
*DefaultDeliTearOff: 1
*DeliTearOff 1/走纸到撕纸位: ""
